{"completed": true, "response": "{\"more_loop\":\"X\",\"x_loops\":[\"S01-S04：想更亲近/更热情→怕破坏自在、怕像在催回应→收住；这一组动作连续几次回到“喜欢但先别再往前”的状态。\",\"S04-S07：想多关心、盼回应→怕热情是在换保证或讨回应→把热情/期待藏回去→期待又因更在乎而升起来，核心拉扯反复出现。\",\"S07-S10：已经明确盼对方主动靠近→S08又回到“像最初那样、不用许诺也很开心”→S09再次惦记回应并想收回期待→S10才决定不再压期待；中间明显绕回了前面到过的状态。\"],\"y_loops\":[\"S01-S04：想多露喜欢/说出心意→怕给对方负担、破坏自在→又收住；但每次露出的程度和对关系的期待都在增加。\",\"S08-S10：开始盼长久→怕以后不再被需要→退回只过好眼前；和S03的“先享受眼前”有一次状态回返。\",\"S11-S14：决定不再藏喜欢→因无法保证以后而疼→S13一度想重新藏一点→最终确认已经回不去、也不再藏；有摆动，但这次摆动本身完成了不可逆的确认。\"],\"why\":\"X在S04-S10之间多次围绕“盼回应—怕形成压力—压回去—又盼回应”循环，数次回到已经到过的心理位置；Y也反复，但多数反复都由新的事实或更深一层的认识推动，尤其最后明确证明自己已经无法退回最初的隐藏状态。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "400a8e46-a167-490a-aa0c-0da06f425f26", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T073415668619Z", "elapsed_seconds": 23.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:34:38.937373+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9a97ae1192095f4ed76f5f15add98580811dc5b7bd566388b3ad34b79e0e6528", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e